    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking lisinopril for my blood pressure like my doctor told me to but lately im getting kinda dizzy every time i stand up too fast. i feel like maybe my BP is dropped too low or something? id it make sense to maybe take a double dose tomorrow morning just to get through the adjustment period or should i just change the time i take it? cuz the dizziness is driving me crazy",
