    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're saying to call the doctor but honestly i cant get an appointment for like two weeks and i dont want to wait that long feeling like this. it feels like i just need to stabilize my system. like if i take a slightly higher dose tomorrow i can just ride it out until the dizziness stops? i just want to feel normal again so what do u think about just doubling up once to see if it helps?",
